the union for CCAI.

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:12.660
Really happy to have you.

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:13.830
I'm Antony Passemard.

00:00:13.830 --> 00:00:17.510
I lead our conversational
AI product at Google Cloud,

00:00:17.510 --> 00:00:19.260
and really excited
about all the things

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:20.820
we're going to talk about.

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:23.100
It's an exciting
time because we are

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:25.350
in the middle of a revolution.

00:00:25.350 --> 00:00:27.530
It's a revolution
of conversational AI

00:00:27.530 --> 00:00:30.500
and conversational technology.

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:32.509
CEOs are already
adopting the technology.

00:00:32.509 --> 00:00:37.430
About 31% of CEOs have deployed
conversational AI platform.

