00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.680
This is a very big change,
too, because right now it's

00:01:08.680 --> 00:01:10.060
only about 25%.

00:01:10.060 --> 00:01:13.190
It was 25% a couple
of years ago.

00:01:13.190 --> 00:01:15.770
Also a big change
that is happening.

00:01:15.770 --> 00:01:18.050
Customers and consumers
of your product

00:01:18.050 --> 00:01:20.490
