00:10:19.970 --> 00:10:21.210
The list goes on and on.

00:10:21.210 --> 00:10:23.360
The adoption of Dialogflow
has been incredible.

00:10:23.360 --> 00:10:26.430
And especially in the last
year and a half, two years,

00:10:26.430 --> 00:10:30.330
