00:10:32.370 --> 00:10:36.660
1.4 million developers have
signed up on the platform.

00:10:36.660 --> 00:10:39.880
This is a massive
increase from last year.

00:10:39.880 --> 00:10:43.110
This is because we support
up to 22 languages,

00:10:43.110 --> 00:10:44.550
and there's more coming.

00:10:44.550 --> 00:10:46.740
We have one-click
integration with partners

00:10:46.740 --> 00:10:49.950
