a Dialogflow bot behind it.

00:10:49.950 --> 00:10:51.630
Partners like AVaya, Genesis.

00:10:51.630 --> 00:10:55.810
SignalWire, Box Implant,
or [INAUDIBLE] notes.

00:10:55.810 --> 00:11:00.130
Dialogflow can scale to massive
amount of agents and intents,

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:03.150
20,000 intents per agent.

00:11:03.150 --> 00:11:05.380
That allows basically,
if you simplify,

00:11:05.380 --> 00:11:08.010
