00:11:10.440 --> 00:11:16.357
This is an order of magnitude
bigger than most out there.

00:11:16.357 --> 00:11:17.940
Dialogflow is HIPAA
and PCI compliant,

00:11:17.940 --> 00:11:20.580
and easily used in health
care and financial services,

00:11:20.580 --> 00:11:21.930
