00:11:21.930 --> 00:11:25.140
And really, we're seeing that
enterprise adoption, enterprise

00:11:25.140 --> 00:11:32.070
growth, Dialogflow becoming
the standard for building bots

00:11:32.070 --> 00:11:34.630
