00:28:06.380 --> 00:28:08.750
- Contact Center AI brings
the best of Google AI

00:28:08.750 --> 00:28:09.800
to customer service.

00:28:09.800 --> 00:28:10.740
[END PLAYBACK]

00:28:10.740 --> 00:28:11.440
ANTONY PASSEMARD:
But you're saying,

00:28:11.440 --> 00:28:13.630
I find it a little fast,
so we could slow it

00:28:13.630 --> 00:28:15.260
down a little bit.

00:28:15.260 --> 00:28:17.890
But the voice is clearly
distinct and clearly the same

00:28:17.890 --> 00:28:19.256
as the actor.

00:28:19.256 --> 00:28:24.120
So that technology is available
for any customer following

00:28:24.120 --> 00:28:25.430
an ethics review.

00:28:25.430 --> 00:28:27.760
I want to use custom voice
inside Dialogflow CX,

00:28:27.760 --> 00:28:30.580
for example, for
the IVR experience,

00:28:30.580 --> 00:28:33.780
or any kind of voice
experience they want.

00:28:33.780 --> 00:28:36.450
One customer was very keen
on using custom voice.

00:28:36.450 --> 00:28:38.580
That customer is Verizon.

00:28:38.580 --> 00:28:41.580
Verizon has entered a digital
transformation of that contact

00:28:41.580 --> 00:28:44.920
center experience using the
best of contact center AI

00:28:44.920 --> 00:28:48.580
